  "body": "Seize this fantastic opportunity to secure a versatile 3 + 2 bedroom property, offering an exciting combination of comfortable family living, a well-considered layout and income potential.\r\n\r\n• Macleans Primary zone\r\n• Potential for granny flat\r\n• 419 sqm freehold site\r\n• Ample off street parking\r\n• Brick-and-tile construction\r\n\r\nThis home is ready for some renovation and a fresh new look. While it may need some updating, that’s exactly where the opportunity lies. With a little imagination, some hands-on work and the right finishing touches, you can breathe new life into this property and create a beautiful home tailored to your own taste — while adding value along the way.\r\n\r\nSet peacefully away from the hustle and bustle on its own 419 sqm site, this attractive home features spacious open-plan living in the main dwelling, 3 double bedrooms and a full bathroom, plus a guest toilet.\r\n\r\nThe 2-bedroom wing is serviced by its own bathroom and a lounge.\r\n\r\nGenerous off-street parking provides ample space for a boat, trailer and additional vehicles.\r\n\r\nConveniently located with easy access to local schools, Highland Park Shopping Centre and nearby parks, not to mention Half Moon Bay and two iconic beaches, this is a home that combines comfort, convenience and practical family living.\r\n\r\nAn opportunity you won't want to miss — come and see what makes it such an appealing place to call home. Call Betty right now!",
